      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果你能让我们看看……\n用叶子攻击的招式<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>飞叶快刀<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n飞天螳螂应该就能再次掌握精髓了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C4F6080FD8BA962114EEC770B770B20262026000A752853F65B50653B51FB768462DB5F0F00100002FF00000698DE53F65FEB520000100002FF000000FF0C00100001BE00000A98DE592987B387825E948BE55C3180FD518D6B21638C63E17CBE9AD34E86300200100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "试试让宝可梦向这边的\n替身人偶使出<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>飞叶快刀<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>这招吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
